    "teacher_markdown": "**Assessment Opportunity**\r\n\r\nUse this level to confirm students understand vulnerabilities well enough to choose defenses that address them.\r\n- If students mix up pillars (e.g., calling a data-leak problem “availability”), briefly revisit the CIA and AAA definitions.\r\n- If students describe problems without naming a specific system weakness, point them back to their shaded diagrams and ask: What part of the system could fail?\r\n- If students demonstrate strong understanding, move on to selecting layered defenses within the cost and friction budget.",
